# =============================================================================
# Portfolio — Environment (Proxmox multi-LXC)
# Paste ke Dokploy → Compose → Environment
#
# Infrastruktur (LXC terpisah):
#   [LXC Cloudflare] cloudflared tunnel
#   [LXC NPM]        Nginx Proxy Manager
#   [LXC Dokploy]    Dokploy + Traefik + portfolio
#
# Traffic:
#   Internet
#     → Cloudflare LXC (TLS / Tunnel)
#     → NPM LXC  (Proxy Host → IP LXC Dokploy)
#     → Dokploy Traefik :80  (LXC Dokploy)
#     → portfolio:${APP_PORT} (Docker internal)
#
# Catatan: antar LXC TIDAK ada Docker DNS.
# NPM harus forward ke IP/hostname LXC Dokploy, bukan "dokploy-traefik".
# =============================================================================

# --- Runtime (dipakai docker-compose di LXC Dokploy) ---
NODE_ENV=production

# Port internal nginx di container portfolio
# Harus sama dengan Container Port di Dokploy Domains
APP_PORT=3000

# --- Identitas app / Dokploy Domains ---
APP_DOMAIN=portfolio.example.com
APP_SERVICE=portfolio

# --- Alamat LXC (ganti sesuai Proxmox-mu) ---
# IP atau hostname LXC tempat Dokploy + Traefik berjalan
DOKPLOY_LXC_HOST=192.168.1.50

# Port Traefik yang terekspos di LXC Dokploy (biasanya 80)
# NPM di LXC lain forward ke sini
DOKPLOY_TRAEFIK_PORT=80

# (Opsional) referensi LXC lain — tidak dipakai compose, hanya dokumentasi
NPM_LXC_HOST=192.168.1.51
CLOUDFLARE_LXC_HOST=192.168.1.52

# =============================================================================
# Checklist konfigurasi
# =============================================================================
#
# 1) Dokploy Domains (di LXC Dokploy):
#      Host            = ${APP_DOMAIN}
#      Service         = ${APP_SERVICE}
#      Container Port  = ${APP_PORT}
#      HTTPS           = OFF
#      Certificate     = None
#
# 2) NPM Proxy Host (di LXC NPM):
#      Domain Names    = ${APP_DOMAIN}
#      Scheme          = http
#      Forward Host    = ${DOKPLOY_LXC_HOST}
#      Forward Port    = ${DOKPLOY_TRAEFIK_PORT}
#      SSL             = off  (TLS di Cloudflare)
#      Websockets      = on   (opsional)
#
# 3) Cloudflare Tunnel (di LXC Cloudflare):
#      Public hostname = ${APP_DOMAIN}
#      Service         = http://${NPM_LXC_HOST}:80
#      (atau port HTTP NPM-mu; TLS tetap di Cloudflare edge)
#
# 4) Firewall / Proxmox:
#      Cloudflare LXC  →  NPM LXC :80 (atau port NPM)
#      NPM LXC         →  Dokploy LXC :${DOKPLOY_TRAEFIK_PORT}
#      Jangan buka 80/443 Dokploy ke internet jika semua lewat tunnel
#
# 5) Compose portfolio:
#      Hanya expose internal + dokploy-network (tidak publish port ke host)
# =============================================================================
